### ============================================================
### AI TOUR RWANDA - API TEST FILE
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================
### ✅ PUBLIC ENDPOINTS (No Auth Required)
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Get AI Provider Status (PUBLIC)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/provider-info

### 1.2 Chat (PUBLIC)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello! What experiences do you recommend in Rwanda?",
  "language": "English"
}

### 1.3 Planner (PUBLIC)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/planner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "Kigali",
  "days": 3,
  "budget": 500,
  "travelers": 2
}

### 1.4 Search (PUBLIC)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/search?query=gorilla trekking&limit=10

### 1.5 Suggestions (PUBLIC)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/suggestions

### ============================================================
### ✅ PROTECTED ENDPOINTS (Auth Required)
### ============================================================

